  There's guide to my level ling up strategies in message id:

<http://groups.google.co.uk/group/rec.games.roguelike.nethack/msg/cb7991531f351ca2>


  It's probably too late in your game for the best strategies in 
the post.

  The quickest, most certain way is probably reverse genociding 
wraiths on a non-graveyard level, while not satiated with 
high magic cancellation armor.  No point losing levels to
wraiths.


  Consorting with foocubi depends on finding one, as they cannot
be reverse-geno'd.  Still, the spoiler on foocubus dancing is 
here:
<http://www.nethack.de/wrap.phtml/spoiler330/succubi.txt>





  Note that RGRN dogma is to keep your character levels low to 
avoid Archons.  Although there have been recent posts pointing 
out that the difference in Archon generation is minimal.  See:

<http://groups.google.co.uk/group/rec.games.roguelike.nethack/msg/0066b437025da5e9>

  Still, if you highly value not facing Archons, don't level up.



